flowchart LR
  bundle["Immutable application bundle"]
  release["Release orchestrator contract"]
  migration["Idempotent SQL migration"]
  database["Approved SQL database"]
  app["Compatible application binary"]
  readiness["Readiness / rollback evidence"]
  bundle -->|promote exact digest| release
  release -->|expand before deploy| migration
  migration -.->|separately approved apply| database
  release -.->|same reviewed binary| app
  database -.->|compatible expanded schema| app
  app -.->|observed health / recovery| readiness
